        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a95088b7-3a2d-3e4f-bb71-6032fb5dc499",
                "word": "neersabelen",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8fd2b3b1-6c6f-399e-84d0-147bf6b5f5fb",
                        "entry_id": "a95088b7-3a2d-3e4f-bb71-6032fb5dc499",
                        "glosses": [
                            "met een sabel neerslaan of doden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "301d1343-6319-3e2d-89da-fa6de4972354",
                        "entry_id": "a95088b7-3a2d-3e4f-bb71-6032fb5dc499",
                        "glosses": [
                            "vernietigend bekritiseren"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5978f73c-366a-4878-ae18-8d206ed6d5ac",
                                "sense_id": "301d1343-6319-3e2d-89da-fa6de4972354",
                                "text": "Nu de eerste storm is gaan liggen, durft hij voorzichtig te concluderen dat Wat ons niet zal doden de hoofdpijn wellicht waard is. Twee uur nadat het boek was uitgekomen verschenen al vernietigende kritieken. Maar de recensenten die de tijd namen om het boek uit te lezen, lijken wel positief te zijn. \"Ik ben blij dat kranten als The New York Times en The Guardian het boek niet neersabelen in hun recensies. En nu ook de fans van Stieg Larsson positief zijn, merk ik dat het tij keert. Gelukkig maar.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20a1a4d1-f14d-40a9-abab-612b4d5cf968",
                                "sense_id": "301d1343-6319-3e2d-89da-fa6de4972354",
                                "text": "“Ik ben fier, omdat het lange tijd bij gedachten bleef'. Sinds zeven jaar sluimerde het idee in haar hoofd. Een opleiding tot goudsmid brak ze af, maar ze liet zich niet afschrikken. Ook niet door critici, die elke stap in haar huidig leven willen neersabelen. 'Ik wil niet afhankelijk zijn van de staat en op kosten van de belastingbetaler leven'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "206e750f-829d-49e4-a815-da97bc9893b3",
                                "sense_id": "301d1343-6319-3e2d-89da-fa6de4972354",
                                "text": "Na afronding van zijn opleiding aan de Filmacademie richtte Van der Heyde in 1963, samen met onder anderen medestudenten Pim de la Parra en Wim Verstappen, het filmtijdschrift Skoop op. Het magazine, bedoeld om de gevestigde filmwereld op te schudden, was spraakmakend. Films van gevestigde regisseurs als Bert Haanstra werden neergesabeld."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9bdf680d-3c8a-4fc4-ae0b-7333b170c63d",
                        "source_entry_id": "a95088b7-3a2d-3e4f-bb71-6032fb5dc499",
                        "source_sense_id": "8fd2b3b1-6c6f-399e-84d0-147bf6b5f5fb",
                        "source_sense_description": "(figuurlijk) vernietigend bekritiseren",
                        "target_lang_word": "take down",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "take down",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ced5b3f-e9db-3172-bd6f-a69122ee172e",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To remove something from a wall or similar vertical surface to which it is fixed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12ccbe0b-41fa-4f67-9172-ca4b666d88c0",
                                                "sense_id": "9ced5b3f-e9db-3172-bd6f-a69122ee172e",
                                                "text": "He took down the picture and replaced it with the framed photograph."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76afd7ae-659e-30d0-9dff-a809b5995eef",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To remove something from a hanging position."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64918abe-b6ba-465d-a120-199be10c9b65",
                                                "sense_id": "76afd7ae-659e-30d0-9dff-a809b5995eef",
                                                "text": "We need to take down the curtains to be cleaned."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76171744-0776-32e9-a220-1cb323486e69",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To remove something from a website."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff0082bf-dee9-4b08-b941-ead4aaa5de7c",
                                                "sense_id": "76171744-0776-32e9-a220-1cb323486e69",
                                                "text": "We must take this fake news item down today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3310a521-a65c-30bf-9eea-42622874ed74",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To write down as a note, especially to record something spoken."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6625a7ac-2b9b-4e18-a6e5-b13b4224e49e",
                                                "sense_id": "3310a521-a65c-30bf-9eea-42622874ed74",
                                                "text": "If you have a pen, you can take down my phone number."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff224f78-42bc-4015-bf8e-f05f69b9b24a",
                                                "sense_id": "3310a521-a65c-30bf-9eea-42622874ed74",
                                                "text": "But if you ask me to bus my children / I hope the cops take down your name"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1375c5b-900f-31de-bab2-f0e7edf1a2a8",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To remove a temporary structure such as scaffolding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "305af242-004d-4185-a6ce-03d4fe2a1e49",
                                                "sense_id": "e1375c5b-900f-31de-bab2-f0e7edf1a2a8",
                                                "text": "When everything else is packed, we can take down the tent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25cda616-a6c9-3cc8-99f7-1db07ef380f7",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To lower an item of clothing without removing it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5942a794-58b2-460d-805f-a323bb3a5bec",
                                                "sense_id": "25cda616-a6c9-3cc8-99f7-1db07ef380f7",
                                                "text": "The doctor asked me to take down my trousers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c2a6f2c-d848-39b7-bf2e-99010256e679",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To arrest someone or to place them in detention."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60f832d9-ef70-4b8b-837d-7d44cf0b4121",
                                                "sense_id": "5c2a6f2c-d848-39b7-bf2e-99010256e679",
                                                "text": "We've got enough evidence now to take McFee down."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ee1944f-8092-4836-88d7-ae08f351bce5",
                                                "sense_id": "5c2a6f2c-d848-39b7-bf2e-99010256e679",
                                                "text": "You have been found guilty. Take the prisoner down."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c0f14a4-7d1a-3a9a-82e4-d7ba6e6a5f68",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To swallow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18f36de8-b337-4820-a8ba-96f39e08d1f7",
                                                "sense_id": "8c0f14a4-7d1a-3a9a-82e4-d7ba6e6a5f68",
                                                "text": "I took down the medicine and soon felt better."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5bc0ecf-3b86-49a6-bd4d-98473dc0b331",
                                                "sense_id": "8c0f14a4-7d1a-3a9a-82e4-d7ba6e6a5f68",
                                                "text": "Marcus Seltz, who can take down a bucket of crab legs like a freaking combine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8da895a6-f725-3de4-9b68-055f214f8cc5",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To defeat; to destroy or kill (a person)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2627b53-06b6-4b41-99c8-d279dc2c72de",
                                                "sense_id": "8da895a6-f725-3de4-9b68-055f214f8cc5",
                                                "text": "It took me eight years to get enough on the asshole to try and take him down."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "243ed077-99a6-47be-94d1-571c659daf16",
                                                "sense_id": "8da895a6-f725-3de4-9b68-055f214f8cc5",
                                                "text": "They'd had occasion to see Peyton Armistead in all his righteous fury and she knew they wouldn't hesitate to take him down if she gave the word."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f8bc98e-f465-4929-a36d-c78f0a0945dc",
                                                "sense_id": "8da895a6-f725-3de4-9b68-055f214f8cc5",
                                                "text": "So Marinus, me and a few other unthanked individuals - Atemporals for the most part, with some mortal collaborators — make it our business to ...take them down."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "341f23a8-d48b-3542-b50f-8ebcfb0edbf9",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To force one’s opponent off their feet in order to transition from striking to grappling in jujitsu, mixed martial arts, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da00bd2d-4595-3b18-ad3d-4fd378c7605b",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To collapse or become incapacitated from illness or fatigue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "704b0459-236a-4502-a21a-826dac60aa0a",
                                                "sense_id": "da00bd2d-4595-3b18-ad3d-4fd378c7605b",
                                                "text": "\"[…]I mind the year after we came, my father took down with the ague, and things looked dark enough for a while; but, when old Billy Slater, on the Clear Fork killed a fat cow, he loaded a lot of the choicest on to a horse and brought it to us;[…]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bd97819-e8ae-4229-a172-e9d5e234307b",
                                                "sense_id": "da00bd2d-4595-3b18-ad3d-4fd378c7605b",
                                                "text": "My brothers and sisters come working the fruit trees, / And they rode the truck till they took down and died."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae2f0f0e-c647-35dd-98c2-f7724da09c71",
                                        "entry_id": "358a1fe1-b2c9-3a01-ba7b-0fc93b82fba3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reduce."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54e510f1-03dd-48ac-b266-0f78bb4ff2f4",
                                                "sense_id": "ae2f0f0e-c647-35dd-98c2-f7724da09c71",
                                                "text": "to take the volume down a bit"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
